&lt;hr data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;119&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;121&quot; data-end=&quot;135&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;121&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;426&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Deal Desk Manager to own and scale our enterprise deal review and approval process. This role is critical to how we structure and close complex, high-value deals, ensuring they are priced correctly, compliant with policy, and aligned with long-term revenue strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;428&quot; data-end=&quot;868&quot;&gt;As the central approval layer for non-standard and enterprise quotes, you will partner closely with Sales, RevOps, Finance, Legal, and Leadership to accelerate deal velocity while maintaining rigor around pricing, discounting, contract terms, and revenue impact. If you enjoy operating at the intersection of strategy, analytics, and execution—and being the trusted partner sales teams rely on to close complex deals—this role is for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;870&quot; data-end=&quot;873&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;899&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;903&quot; data-end=&quot;1809&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;903&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;905&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary approval authority for enterprise and non-standard deals prior to customer delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1155&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1015&quot; data-end=&quot;1155&quot;&gt;Review and approve pricing, discounting, commercial terms, payment structures, and deal exceptions within established approval frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1156&quot; data-end=&quot;1296&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1158&quot; data-end=&quot;1296&quot;&gt;Partner with Sales to structure creative, compliant deal solutions that meet customer needs while protecting margin and long-term value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1297&quot; data-end=&quot;1433&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1299&quot; data-end=&quot;1433&quot;&gt;Work closely with Finance, Legal, RevOps, and Product to ensure accurate quoting, contract compliance, and proper revenue treatment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1434&quot; data-end=&quot;1554&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1436&quot; data-end=&quot;1554&quot;&gt;Own and continuously improve deal desk processes, approval matrices, and documentation to ensure scalable workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1555&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1557&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;Analyze deal metrics (discounting, deal velocity, approval turnaround, win/loss drivers) and surface actionable insights for leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1696&quot; data-end=&quot;1809&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1809&quot;&gt;Support leadership with deal-related insights, escalations, and recommendations on high-impact opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1811&quot; data-end=&quot;1814&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1816&quot; data-end=&quot;1836&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1816&quot; data-end=&quot;1834&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1838&quot; data-end=&quot;2519&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1838&quot; data-end=&quot;1972&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1840&quot; data-end=&quot;1972&quot;&gt;2–4+ years of experience in Deal Desk, Sales Operations, Revenue Operations, Finance, or a related role in a B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1975&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;Proven experience supporting complex, enterprise-level SaaS deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2044&quot; data-end=&quot;2132&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2046&quot; data-end=&quot;2132&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of SaaS pricing models, contract structures, and sales motions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2133&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2135&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;High attention to detail with the ability to balance precision and speed in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2239&quot; data-end=&quot;2315&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2241&quot; data-end=&quot;2315&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and financial modeling skills (Excel / Google Sheets).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2316&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2318&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to influence cross-functional stakeholders, including senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2440&quot; data-end=&quot;2519&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2442&quot; data-end=&quot;2519&quot;&gt;Experience working in Salesforce (required) and familiarity with CPQ tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2521&quot; data-end=&quot;2539&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2521&quot; data-end=&quot;2537&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2541&quot; data-end=&quot;2992&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2541&quot; data-end=&quot;2592&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2543&quot; data-end=&quot;2592&quot;&gt;Experience with cloud marketplace transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2593&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2595&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;Experience with usage-based, consumption-based, or hybrid SaaS pricing models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2676&quot; data-end=&quot;2738&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2678&quot; data-end=&quot;2738&quot;&gt;Familiarity with revenue recognition principles (ASC 606).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2739&quot; data-end=&quot;2829&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2741&quot; data-end=&quot;2829&quot;&gt;Experience building or scaling deal desk functions in early or growth-stage companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2830&quot; data-end=&quot;2901&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2832&quot; data-end=&quot;2901&quot;&gt;Background in consulting, investment banking, or strategic finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2902&quot; data-end=&quot;2992&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2904&quot; data-end=&quot;2992&quot;&gt;Experience creating deal playbooks, pricing guidelines, or sales enablement materials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2994&quot; data-end=&quot;2997&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2999&quot; data-end=&quot;3017&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2999&quot; data-end=&quot;3015&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3019&quot; data-end=&quot;3354&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3019&quot; data-end=&quot;3118&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3021&quot; data-end=&quot;3118&quot;&gt;Be part of a high-impact, cross-functional team shaping how we sell and scale enterprise deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3119&quot; data-end=&quot;3203&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3121&quot; data-end=&quot;3203&quot;&gt;Directly influence deal quality, sales efficiency, and long-term unit economics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3204&quot; data-end=&quot;3309&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3206&quot; data-end=&quot;3309&quot;&gt;Opportunity for professional growth and high visibility in a fast-paced, innovative SaaS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3310&quot; data-end=&quot;3354&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3312&quot; data-end=&quot;3354&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3356&quot; data-end=&quot;3359&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3361&quot; data-end=&quot;3434&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3361&quot; data-end=&quot;3378&quot;&gt;Salary Range:&lt;/strong&gt; $140K–$185K&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3436&quot; data-end=&quot;3451&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3436&quot; data-end=&quot;3449&quot;&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3453&quot; data-end=&quot;3719&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3453&quot; data-end=&quot;3484&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3455&quot; data-end=&quot;3484&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Equity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3485&quot; data-end=&quot;3519&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3487&quot; data-end=&quot;3519&quot;&gt;401(k) Program &amp;amp; Company Match&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3520&quot; data-end=&quot;3566&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3522&quot; data-end=&quot;3566&quot;&gt;Health, Dental, Vision, and Life Insurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3567&quot; data-end=&quot;3606&quot;&gt;PTO + Holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;181&quot; data-end=&quot;214&quot;&gt;DevOps Engineer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;264&quot; data-end=&quot;302&quot;&gt;Hi. I’m Ron, Eon’s co-founder and CTO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;304&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;I’ll be direct: Eon is at the most crucial moment in its journey, and we’re looking for exceptional engineers to help take the company to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;459&quot; data-end=&quot;849&quot;&gt;We’ve done what no one else has managed to do — make backups actually useful. We built a cloud-native backup and recovery platform for enterprises running across multi-cloud environments. Eon turns backup data into a strategic asset, giving enterprises visibility, control, and real usability at scale. We’re trusted by global enterprises, and we’re building a once-in-a-generation company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;851&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;In other words: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;NOW is the time to join us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;903&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;905&quot; data-end=&quot;922&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;924&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a DevOps Engineer who is ready to operate at the highest level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1353&quot;&gt;This is a core role at Eon. You’ll own the infrastructure that powers our platform across AWS, Azure, and GCP, enabling massive scale, performance, reliability, and security. You’ll work directly with me and the engineering leadership to design and evolve our cloud architecture, CI/CD pipelines, and Kubernetes environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1355&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;This is not a role for someone who wants tickets and hand-holding. You’ll have real ownership, real impact, and the autonomy to shape how we build and operate our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1529&quot; data-end=&quot;1532&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1534&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;2314&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1555&quot; data-end=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;Design, build, and operate multi-cloud infrastructure at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1555&quot; data-end=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Build and evolve CI/CD pipelines that enable fast, safe, and reliable deployments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1555&quot; data-end=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1634&quot; data-end=&quot;1725&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;1725&quot;&gt;Own infrastructure as code using Terraform (and CloudFormation/Bicep where relevant).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;1814&quot;&gt;Operate and troubleshoot managed Kubernetes environments (EKS, AKS, GKE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1895&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1897&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;Push infrastructure performance, reliability, and availability to the limit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1974&quot; data-end=&quot;2061&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1976&quot; data-end=&quot;2061&quot;&gt;Implement cloud security best practices (IAM, secrets, encryption, network security).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2062&quot; data-end=&quot;2155&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2064&quot; data-end=&quot;2155&quot;&gt;Partner closely with backend, security, and data teams to enable high-velocity development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2156&quot; data-end=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2158&quot; data-end=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;Make key architectural decisions and influence the future of Eon’s platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2235&quot; data-end=&quot;2314&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2237&quot; data-end=&quot;2314&quot;&gt;Bring your opinions, ideas, and instincts to the table — I want to hear them.&lt;/p&gt;
