&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3290&quot; data-end=&quot;3293&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;3295&quot; data-end=&quot;3311&quot;&gt;Why Join Eon?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3313&quot; data-end=&quot;3507&quot;&gt;Eon is one of the fastest-growing startups in cloud infrastructure and cyber security. We’re extremely well-funded, trusted by global enterprises, and tackling problems that actually matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3509&quot; data-end=&quot;3732&quot;&gt;At the same time, we’re lean, flat, and execution-focused. You’ll work directly with me, be part of the core team shaping the company, and see your work change how enterprises protect and operate their cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3734&quot; data-end=&quot;3872&quot;&gt;We demand a lot — because what we’re building is big.&lt;br data-start=&quot;3787&quot; data-end=&quot;3790&quot;&gt;And we take care of our people — because great companies are built by great teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3874&quot; data-end=&quot;4034&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to do the best work of your career and build something truly meaningful, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3963&quot; data-end=&quot;3991&quot;&gt;now is the time to apply&lt;/strong&gt; — even if you don’t tick every single box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Campaign Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;US-NY, US-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on a mission to revolutionize the cloud infrastructure backup industry for enterprise customers. Led by a team of successful serial entrepreneurs and ex-Amazon senior leaders, we secured $500M in funding in from prominent VCs like Sequoia, Lightspeed, Greenoaks, BOND, and Elad Gil, and we’re gearing up for an exciting journey and rapid growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Digital Campaign Marketing Manager who is equal parts creative strategist and analytical powerhouse. You&#39;ll be the glue between our most ambitious marketing initiatives: from high-touch ABM to pillar content releases and global event launches. You&#39;ll help to ensure we reach the right target accounts with the right message at the perfect time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect Multi-Channel ABM: Partner with Sales, Marketing Ops, and RevOps to design and execute high-impact ABM campaigns that drive pipeline against target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Database Segmentation: Own the audience architecture to ensure highly relevant, personalized outreach across our entire database.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Nurture Strategy: Build sophisticated nurture streams that drive thought leadership, deepen content engagement, and accelerate Lead-to-MQL conversion,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Tentpole Launches: Launch integrated digital campaigns to amplify our event sponsorships and major content drops, ensuring maximum ROI from our biggest bets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help drive Brand Awareness: Execute third-party sponsorships and influencer programs to build authority and engagement within our ICP.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize and Report: Maintain a rigorous focus on performance, constantly reporting on and optimizing programs to meet pipeline targets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a Team Player: Collaborate cross-functionally with Events, Content, and Analytics teams to ensure a unified and friction-free brand experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Strategy &amp;amp; Budget: Partner with the Director of Demand Generation to forecast campaign spend scenarios and take creative swings that help drive engagement with our ICP.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience leading integrated digital campaigns and ABM programs in a B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of partnering with Sales and RevOps to move the needle on target account engagement and pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Funnel guru with a strong grasp of B2B funnel metrics and attribution modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tool Proficiency: in Marketing automation (e.g., Marketo/Hubspot), CRM (e.g., Salesforce), and ABM platforms (e.g., 6sense/Demandbase).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Creative: Comfortable toggling between campaign creative direction and deep-dive performance reporting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event &amp;amp; Content Savvy: Experience supporting large-scale event sponsorships and content-led growth initiatives to drive engagement &amp;amp; demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Communicator: Ability to share campaign roadmaps and translate campaign data and performance into actionable insights for cross-functional stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startup Ready: A proactive self-starter who stays curious, thinks in AI-powered systems, and thrives in high-growth, fast-paced environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a passionate and innovative team driving change in the cloud backup space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for professional growth in a fast-paced startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(K) Program &amp;amp; Company Match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, Dental, Vision, &amp;amp; Life Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short Term and Long Term Disability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-Office/Home Office Setup Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off (PTO) + Holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Eon, we’re transforming cloud backups into useful assets for the first time ever. Backed by prominent investors and industry leaders, our groundbreaking Cloud Backup Posture Management (CBPM) platform offers instant visibility and access across all cloud environments, turning every backup into a searchable, accessible tool. We’re an ambitious, collaborative team driven to redefine what’s possible in cloud technology. Join us, and see how your contributions can directly shape the future of backup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a motivated, results-driven &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; based in Texas to join our growing team. In this role, you’ll be responsible for building sales from the ground up, developing relationships with the companies we work with, finding new business opportunities, and delivering top-notch service. The ideal candidate has solid experience in the backup industry, a strong background in enterprise sales, and a history of working with products that make a real difference for businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a &lt;strong&gt;sales strategy&lt;/strong&gt; to drive new business from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;sales targets&lt;/strong&gt; and KPIs consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiate contracts&lt;/strong&gt; and close deals to maximize profits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the sales team to identify new opportunities within your territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;key decision-makers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the entire sales cycle, from prospecting to closing deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular feedback on sales performance and market trends to senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely and successful delivery of our products based on client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;8+ years of sales experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including at least 4 years in enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in &lt;strong&gt;prospecting&lt;/strong&gt; and identifying new leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing deals, particularly in &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise SaaS&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at building trust and long-term partnerships with diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re passionate about acquiring new business and exceeding sales targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong experience negotiating &lt;strong&gt;complex deals&lt;/strong&gt; with a focus on win-win outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Be part of a passionate and innovative team driving change in the cloud backup space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for professional growth in a fast-paced startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on a mission to revolutionize the cloud infrastructure backup industry for enterprise customers. Led by a team of successful serial entrepreneurs and ex-Amazon senior leaders, we secured $500 million in funding from prominent VCs like Sequoia, Lightspeed, Greenoaks, BOND and Elad Gil, and we’re gearing up for an exciting journey and rapid growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a smart, forward-thinking Field Marketing Manager who brings creativity and enthusiasm to the table (and gets &amp;amp;$@# done). If you&#39;re excited about creating one-of-a-kind in-person events and experiences that help drive our business forward, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute fun and unique customer-facing events that drive business growth and brand awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support company engagement in industry conferences (e.g., AWS re:Invent, Google Cloud Next) including pre/during/post conference activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage all event logistics including: sourcing activities and venues, swag, managing guest lists and event websites, coordinating with internal teams to drive registrations, and managing external vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute event marketing materials (email and social) to successfully drive registrations and attendance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new sponsorship and event opportunities to align our brand to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and ability to project manage across multiple internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of event or field marketing experience, preferably in a B2B capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to project manage and multi-task across multiple events at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and proactive communicator who’s not afraid to ask questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work independently and strategically in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a passionate and innovative team driving change in the cloud backup space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for professional growth in a fast-paced startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary range:$90K-$150K&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) Program &amp;amp; Company Match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, Dental, Vision, and Life Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short Term and Long Term Disability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous Work Environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-Office/Home Office Setup Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off (PTO) + Holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-Office Perks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;134&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot;&gt;Global IT Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;483&quot;&gt;We are on a mission to revolutionize the cloud infrastructure backup industry for enterprise customers. Led by a team of successful serial entrepreneurs and ex-Amazon senior leaders, we secured $200 million in funding in 2024 from prominent VCs like Sequoia, Lightspeed and Greenoaks, and we’re gearing up for an exciting journey and rapid growth. &amp;nbsp;As we scale, we are looking for a hands-on IT Manager to serve as the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;sole IT function&lt;/strong&gt;, owning the full IT lifecycle for the organization — from infrastructure to security to end-user support.&lt;br&gt;This role is ideal for a proactive, self-starter who enjoys variety, ownership, and building scalable processes from the ground up&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;885&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;IT Operations &amp;amp; End-User Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Act as the primary IT point of contact for all employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Provide day-to-day technical support (Tier 1–2) for hardware, software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Install, configure, and maintain networks, operating systems, and corporate software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve hardware, software, and connectivity issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;User Management &amp;amp; Access Control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Manage the full employee IT lifecycle: onboarding, offboarding, and access provisioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Administer user accounts and permissions across platforms (Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Implement and maintain IAM solutions, SSO, and automated workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Security &amp;amp; Risk Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Maintain IT and data security, including endpoint protection, backups, and network security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Monitor, respond to, and investigate IT incidents and security threats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Define and enforce IT policies and access control procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Maintain internal IT documentation and knowledge base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Develop guides and procedures for employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;4–5+ years of hands-on IT experience, including system administration and Help Desk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing IT as a sole function in a growing company — highly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hands-on expertise with Windows and macOS environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience with IAM (Azure AD, Entra, Okta), MDM&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Networking, firewalls, VPNs, and endpoint security knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills and service mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Fluent in English (written and spoken)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2076&quot; data-end=&quot;2092&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2095&quot; data-end=&quot;2435&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2095&quot; data-end=&quot;2193&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2097&quot; data-end=&quot;2193&quot;&gt;Be part of a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2110&quot; data-end=&quot;2146&quot;&gt;fast-growing, innovative company&lt;/strong&gt; at the forefront of enterprise IT solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2194&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2196&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot;&gt;Opportunity to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2211&quot; data-end=&quot;2231&quot;&gt;grow your career&lt;/strong&gt; and take on new challenges in a dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2287&quot; data-end=&quot;2390&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2289&quot; data-end=&quot;2390&quot;&gt;Collaborate with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2308&quot; data-end=&quot;2342&quot;&gt;passionate and supportive team&lt;/strong&gt; that values impact, innovation, and teamwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2391&quot; data-end=&quot;2435&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2393&quot; data-end=&quot;2435&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;174&quot; data-end=&quot;189&quot;&gt;About EON&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;190&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot;&gt;EON is a fast-growing, global cloud-native data protection company. We help organizations protect and manage their data at scale while simplifying complex infrastructure and compliance requirements. Our teams operate globally, including significant operations in the US, and we are looking for an In-House Tax Advisor to join our Finance team and help scale our tax function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;567&quot; data-end=&quot;690&quot;&gt;At EON, we value ownership, technical depth, and people who can take initiative and make an impact across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;692&quot; data-end=&quot;695&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;697&quot; data-end=&quot;717&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;718&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced In-House Tax Manager with strong expertise in US taxation. This role is responsible for providing hands-on tax guidance across the company, ensuring compliance with US federal and state tax requirements, and supporting strategic business decisions. You will work closely with Finance, Legal, HR, and external advisors to manage risks, optimize tax outcomes, and support growth initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1143&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;This is a strategic, hands-on role with direct impact on EON’s operations and long-term success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1244&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1246&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;2071&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1338&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1338&quot;&gt;Provide day-to-day tax guidance on US federal and state tax matters&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1339&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1341&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot;&gt;Support US operations, including entity structuring, payroll, withholding, and sales/use tax compliance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1447&quot; data-end=&quot;1541&quot;&gt;Advise on commercial contracts, supplier/customer agreements, and cross-border arrangements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1718&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1640&quot; data-end=&quot;1718&quot;&gt;Partner with external US advisors and accounting firms on filings and audits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1719&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Monitor and manage tax compliance and reporting obligations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1842&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;1842&quot;&gt;Identify and mitigate tax risks across the organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1845&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Build and improve internal tax processes, policies, and documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1917&quot; data-end=&quot;1996&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;1996&quot;&gt;Intercompany tax planning and Transfer Pricing matters&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1997&quot; data-end=&quot;2071&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1999&quot; data-end=&quot;2071&quot;&gt;Keep the company updated on regulatory changes and assess their impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2073&quot; data-end=&quot;2076&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2078&quot; data-end=&quot;2101&quot;&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2103&quot; data-end=&quot;2116&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2103&quot; data-end=&quot;2116&quot;&gt;Must Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2117&quot; data-end=&quot;2478&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2117&quot; data-end=&quot;2160&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2119&quot; data-end=&quot;2160&quot;&gt;CPA, Attorney, or certified Tax Advisor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2161&quot; data-end=&quot;2249&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2163&quot; data-end=&quot;2249&quot;&gt;5+ years of US tax experience, ideally in high-tech or fast-growing global companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2250&quot; data-end=&quot;2303&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2252&quot; data-end=&quot;2303&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of US federal and state taxation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2304&quot; data-end=&quot;2373&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2306&quot; data-end=&quot;2373&quot;&gt;Experience working with external US advisors and accounting firms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2374&quot; data-end=&quot;2421&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2376&quot; data-end=&quot;2421&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal English skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2422&quot; data-end=&quot;2478&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2424&quot; data-end=&quot;2478&quot;&gt;Hands-on, independent, and ownership-driven approach&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2480&quot; data-end=&quot;2496&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2480&quot; data-end=&quot;2496&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2497&quot; data-end=&quot;2753&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2497&quot; data-end=&quot;2565&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2499&quot; data-end=&quot;2565&quot;&gt;Prior in-house experience at a technology or high-growth company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2566&quot; data-end=&quot;2620&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2568&quot; data-end=&quot;2620&quot;&gt;Experience with equity plans (RSUs, stock options)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2621&quot; data-end=&quot;2701&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2623&quot; data-end=&quot;2701&quot;&gt;Exposure to international tax, transfer pricing, or cross-border structuring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2702&quot; data-end=&quot;2753&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2704&quot; data-end=&quot;2753&quot;&gt;Experience supporting M&amp;amp;A, fundraising, or IPOs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2755&quot; data-end=&quot;2758&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2760&quot; data-end=&quot;2773&quot;&gt;Why EON&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2774&quot; data-end=&quot;3039&quot;&gt;At EON, you’ll join a global, fast-growing company where you can directly influence our business and compliance processes. This is a chance to build and shape the company’s in-house tax function, work closely with leadership, and contribute to scaling EON globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;Marketing Ops &amp;amp; AI Content Intern (Part-time)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Eon, we’re transforming cloud backups—turning them from passive storage into powerful, searchable assets. Backed by leading investors and guided by experienced founders, we’re growing quickly and building a category-defining platform in one of the most dynamic areas of cloud technology. And we’re building an amazing marketing team and brand to support the revolutionary product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Marketing &amp;amp; AI Intern at Eon, you’ll play a key role in supporting our marketing team day-to-day—help research, plan and roll out projects and campaigns aimed to reach our marketing objectives. This role is ideal for a NYC-based college senior or recent graduate who is highly motivated, detail-oriented, and eager to learn how technology, AI, and marketing intersect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools and build AI agents to make marketing tasks faster and easier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create content to support our blog and social channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track campaign progress and make sure results are recorded accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support website and content performance with research and content tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research new marketing tools, trends, and creative ideas to share with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help keep marketing projects, calendars, and task lists organized and up to date, as well as support tech systems and data hygiene projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current college senior or recent graduate studying Marketing, Communications, Business, Engineering or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI proficiency and strong understanding of how to use AI tools to generate written content (e.g., Gemini, ChatGPT).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with spreadsheets (Google Sheets or Excel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and proactive communicator who’s not afraid to ask questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in marketing analytics, growth, digital campaigns, and how creative ideas drive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about how technology and AI are changing the way marketing teams work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Eon, you’ll work with a small, ambitious team where your contributions make a visible impact. You’ll gain hands-on experience in how a fast-growing tech company plans, executes, and measures marketing efforts. If you’re someone who likes to learn by doing and enjoys solving real problems, this is a great place to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Details:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule: Part-time, January–May (approx. 15–20 hours per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation: $28-$32 per hour, based on experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1771860514.471969&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We’re looking for a highly organized, hands-on &lt;strong&gt;Office &amp;amp; Operations Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt; who thrives in a fast-paced, startup environment.&lt;br&gt;You’ll be the heartbeat of our NYC office, making sure everything runs smoothly, the vibe stays strong, and our team has what they need to do their best work. From onboarding new hires to coordinating events and keeping daily operations on track, you’ll play a key role in shaping the employee experience.&lt;br&gt;If you love solving problems, staying ten steps ahead, and being the go-to person who makes things happen - this role is for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;What You’ll Do&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the office running like a well-oiled machine, organized, stocked, and ready for action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the point person for vendors, deliveries, supplies, and facilities requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new hire onboarding, workspace setup, equipment coordination, welcome moments, and first-day logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jump in on scheduling, travel bookings, and meeting coordination when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help plan and execute team events, happy hours, offsites, and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track office expenses, invoices, and help keep budgets organized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve processes as we grow, if something can be better, we want your ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR and IT to make sure everything behind the scenes just works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;Who You Are&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years of experience in office admin, operations, hospitality, or a similar hands-on role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely organized and detail-oriented, you love a checklist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable juggling multiple tasks without dropping the ball.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Friendly, approachable, and great at communicating with different teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech-savvy and comfortable with Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive mindset, you don’t wait to be told what to fix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energized by startup culture and excited to grow with us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
