&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&amp;nbsp;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;member&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Sales&amp;nbsp;Development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;team, you will be responsible for identifying ideal buyers and engaging them through calls, emails, and social outreach. You will qualify leads by uncovering their needs, pain points, and opportunities, ensuring a strong foundation for meaningful conversations. Your role will also involve setting up product demos and effectively communicating Eon&#39;s value to potential customers. Collaborating closely with Account Executives, you will help maintain a robust pipeline in the CRM and contribute to overall sales success. To thrive in this role, you must be goal-oriented, consistently meeting lead generation and opportunity quotas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;execute&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;sales&amp;nbsp;strategy&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;drive&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;ground&amp;nbsp;up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently&amp;nbsp;meet&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;exceed&amp;nbsp;sales&amp;nbsp;targets&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate&amp;nbsp;contracts&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;close&amp;nbsp;deals&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;maximize&amp;nbsp;profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;sales&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;opportunities&amp;nbsp;within&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;relationships&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide&amp;nbsp;regular&amp;nbsp;feedback&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;sales&amp;nbsp;performance&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;market&amp;nbsp;trends&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;senior&amp;nbsp;management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure&amp;nbsp;timely&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;successful&amp;nbsp;delivery&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;products&amp;nbsp;based&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;client&amp;nbsp;needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3 years in outbound sales or SDR roles (preferably B2B SaaS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional&amp;nbsp;communication&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;organizational&amp;nbsp;skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;detail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;exceeding&amp;nbsp;monthly/quarterly&amp;nbsp;quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;thrive&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;fast-paced&amp;nbsp;environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive&amp;nbsp;cold-calling&amp;nbsp;experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated,&amp;nbsp;resilient,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;goal-driven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sales tools such as Salesforce, Hubspot, ZoomInfo, HG Insights, Cadence tools, Nooks, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, and Grain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be&amp;nbsp;part&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;passionate&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;innovative&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;driving&amp;nbsp;change&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;cloud&amp;nbsp;backup&amp;nbsp;space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;professional&amp;nbsp;growth&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;fast-paced&amp;nbsp;startup&amp;nbsp;environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive&amp;nbsp;salary&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;benefits&amp;nbsp;package.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Eon, we’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We welcome and support applicants and team members regardless of race, religion, gender, age, or background. Compensation at Eon is determined by a range of factors, including relevant experience, skillset, and geographic location. During the hiring process, our Talent Acquisition team will provide more details about the specific salary range for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is eligible to participate in our equity program and may include additional performance-based incentives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Base Salary Range:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;$75,000 – $85,000 USD&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Company Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eon is revolutionizing the enormous and rapidly growing cloud infrastructure resiliency industry for enterprise customers. It is led by the team that founded CloudEndure (Cloud Disaster Recovery and Migration startup, acquired by AWS), and subsequently built two native AWS services, AWS Elastic Disaster Recovery, and AWS Application Migration Service, supporting the world&#39;s largest enterprises. Eon is backed by Sequoia, Lightspeed, among other prominent investors. We are currently seeking an exceptional Sales Engineering Manager to join our fast growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Position Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eon is seeking an experienced Sales Engineering Manager to lead our technical sales team and drive revenue growth for our cloud infrastructure backup solutions. In this role, you&#39;ll bridge the gap between our cutting-edge technology and customer needs, leading a team of sales engineers while personally engaging with target accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a team of sales engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track key performance metrics for the sales engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM leadership to develop and execute technical sales strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct technical discovery sessions with enterprise customers to understand their cloud backup, disaster recovery, and data protection requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create TCO analyses for customers and collaborate with account managers to optimize proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical evaluations for strategic opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor to C-level executives and IT leaders at target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with solution architects, product and engineering teams to communicate customer feedback and influence product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop technical sales collateral, demos, and enablement materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on industry trends in cloud infrastructure, backup technologies, and competitive landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in sales engineering, with 3+ years in a leadership role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of cloud infrastructure (AWS, Azure, GCP), selling technical cloud SaaS products to enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data protection, business continuity, compliance requirements (GDPR, HIPAA, SOC 2), and RPO/RTO concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building and managing high-performing technical sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to navigate complex sales cycles and close enterprise deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional presentation and communication skills, able to explain complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for solving customer problems and delivering exceptional experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 30-40% for customer meetings and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary range: $160K-$205K&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) Program &amp;amp; Company Match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, Dental, Vision, and Life Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short Term and Long Term Disability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous Work Environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-Office/Home Office Setup Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off (PTO) + Holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-Office Perks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

