&lt;p&gt;This is one of the first roles in our expanding marketing team, and you&#39;ll play a pivotal role in shaping our strategy and success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
